# Ensure shell scripts and CI workflows always use LF so they run correctly
# on Linux GitHub Actions runners regardless of a contributor's git settings.
*.sh text eol=lf
.github/workflows/*.yml text eol=lf

# Deployment assets are consumed by Linux: bash, systemd (including
# EnvironmentFile parsing), cron and Caddy. A stray CR does not just look
# untidy — it becomes part of the value. `PORT=7100` is not a number, a
# cron line with CR does not run, and `set -euo pipefail` aborts the script
# with a mangled error. Force LF for everything that ships to a server.
deploy/** text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
